products.description:
Top 5 Key Advantages
- Comfortable for long-term use — reduces shoulder and lower-back strain
@Competitor — Even after 10 minutes of use, the shoulders and lower back become very uncomfortable.

- Easy and safe to put on by yourself
@Competitor — Requires someone else’s help to put it on.

- Transforms into a baby booster seat when dining out
@Competitor — Requires checking with the restaurant or carrying a separate baby booster seat, which adds extra baggage.

- Only 2 steps to take the baby out — unzip and remove the baby
@Competitor — Remove the outer layer, detach the back support, loosen the shoulder straps, and then take the baby out.

- Safe even when the waist belt is loosened
@Competitor — Loosening the waist belt may cause the baby to slip out, making it inconvenient to remove or put on pants when using the restroom.
